Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't getting us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me for Majo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's waiting to\Nfollow me back to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he tries to get\Nin my way, he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This mission is in the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I hearing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did a bomb go off?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better retreat\Nfor now, little bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that Katsone's\Nhiding somewhere nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but I gotta focus on getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna be pretty if I bring out my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,stand with all these\Npeople hanging around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd my face stop bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn he got me pretty deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:00:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too big to be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This behemoth is practically a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,machete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where'd my knife go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way these\Nclown shoes could be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're freaking gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.42,0:01:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, first my knife, now my shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something strange about this seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And this steering wheel,\Nmy arms don't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't touch the pedal,\Nand the seat is crazy big.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even see over the\Ndashboard in this damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd my freaking car go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just sitting in it, so how in the\Nworld did it up and vanish without a trace?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally stuck here\Nwithout those wheels, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a special kind of stupid, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too dense to realize\Nyour whole body is shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning my powers have kicked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like that little\Nscratch I gave you did the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what if these shoes\Nand this knife are mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:01:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That would mean I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So it finally dawned on your dumb ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ship has sailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck driving away from this\Nfight with that body, jailbait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least now I know how\Nthat stalker guy's powers work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are about to tell me where\Nthe boss's daughter is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the pissing contest begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready to spill your guts, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,FIGHTING GOAL
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But these guys need the nourishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been too long, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This just proves that he\Nshouldn't have been the one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You still on about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not get over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you this was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to snap at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything Tiny Feet slices\Nshrinks into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I look mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes a little bit to get started,\Nbut you can't argue with the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:05:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That get-up and bandana you're\Nsporting are shrinking along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The dwindling dimensions of your shoe and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,knife halted the moment\Nthey left your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Put into dead man's terms, your entire\Nworld is outgrowing you at an alarming rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta contact Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on with this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still getting smaller!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so light, the mechanism\Nthat opens the door won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactamente, you blockhead. Still! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want some help,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta get myself to that phone\Nbefore I shrink down to nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the way you open a door!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.16,0:06:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a waste of effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it still hasn't dawned\Non you that your wallet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and clothes have also been\Nshrinking along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't make a phone call\Nwithout a phone card or some coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck phoning your friends\Nwith that pint-sized pocket change!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he has some brains in there after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be in some deep shit if\Nhis buddies find out how I operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And if Bucciarati gets wind of my powers,\Nhe'll just hide the bitch somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be the ultimate disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to act fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:06:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're around here somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Or down here maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got two to three minutes\Nbefore you're the size of a cockroach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon your stand will be as\Ntragically weak as it is small.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll really have\Nsome fun torturing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can already taste victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't find me, but I\Nstill need to wait. Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hiding in my back pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You sneaky bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So your power is shrinking things down,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and you were hiding in my\Npocket this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Freakin' A.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures that your powers would\Nmatch your puny personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he figure out I was in his pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lil' Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Massacre this runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the ballpoint
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,pen you bastard where'd
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you go and what the hell did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You listening quit the stalker\Nshit and fight me fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit that was close it takes a\Nlot of energy to do it so whenever
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,tiny feet has to shrink Anything\Nother than myself i need time on my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,side returning things like that pen\Nto their original Size is another
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,story entirely the instantaneous\Nrepulsion that created catapulted
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,me up and out Of his hands and\Nway over to here that said how did
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the kid know i was there at all\Nguess it's Possible i could have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,been moving around too much and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,tipped him off
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way he
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't have Possibly seen me so\Nhow the hell did he figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away stalker boy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit. Screw this party. Feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.10,0:09:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that asshole go? We're not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was way too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't been for that tire pressure,\NI'd probably be a dead man right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,At least he won't be able to find me, Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No freaking way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stan doesn't just blast shit to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It has another ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow it's finding my location\Nand tracking my every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to be using something more\Nthan just movement or sound detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, how would he have known\Nthat I was hiding out in his pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or that I used that blast of air?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Leaky here, you\Nwere hiding in the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They can still find me even\Nwhen I'm underwater like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Tiny Feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:10:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, think, think, think, think!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hitman team has nine members.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Formaggio is counted among their numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be addressing waste\Nmanagement at the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,During Parliament? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make the Minister of the\NEnvironment choose the best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I just worry you may be working too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:12:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you've had\Nenough to drink this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's with you, Pesci?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really back to drinking milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cut me some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to drink it, but espresso\Nalways makes my tummy all rumbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And you wonder why I refer\Nto you as Mamoni? You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you sipping on milk like\Nsome lame-ass suckling
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't exactly do much\Nfor our reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we even brought you\Nalong with us in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out and get your shit together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Formaggio, how are things going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.50,0:12:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just consider it a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,From me to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then things are moving smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The job's as good as done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.52,0:12:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just sit back and enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get the hell out of\Nhere and go watch some calcium.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was excellent. Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope you will visit us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we finish this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Vino Bang was stupe. What's\Ngoing on? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't park your ass here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that blood seeping\Nout from under the top?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, time to bounce. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Pesci?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your leg's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, we're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Went perfectly, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.64,0:14:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rat bastard's nothing\Nbut a bunch of smoke now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But you offed the bitch\Nwho was tagging along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget. Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your good-for-nothing\Nstance good for something, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like how I work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How much was this job, Malone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,20 million lira.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all it's worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyacho, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll talk finances later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have more pressing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Sorbet and Gelato?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're playing hooky?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're making sweet, sweet love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy kids to be in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, do you ever shut your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something strange here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gelato is one thing, but Sorbet\Ndefinitely likes his money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always count on that one to show\Nup in time to claim his cut of the pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There comes a time in the life\Nof every established organization
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,when the workers finally rise up\Nand rebel against the leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And when smuggling drugs from\NCentral Asia to Europe and the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,can be done cheaply,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,profits can multiply by a hundred\Ntimes more than the original price.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Leading to the phenomenon of\Nthe emboldened risk-taker,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,who attempts to seize up drug lord's\Nterritory even at the cost of their own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there's no sign of them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they must have been eliminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.96,0:15:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they get for\Ntrying to sniff out the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.40,0:15:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo controls the gambling network.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those goons handling the drugs\Nare making a killing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But us Hitman team losers are getting\Nnothing but chump change from the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to get to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't a single person\Nin the Family better than us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We deserve way more respect around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was asphyxiation? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But only gelato's been ID'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have Sorbet's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Several days later, a\Nshipment of anonymous packages
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,mysteriously arrived\Nat the team's doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting out of hand who's sending
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,these if I had a name\Nthat'd be all she wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a frame but this\Nisn't a painting so is this some
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of modern art I see something
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.54,0:16:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird floating in them. What
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,look inside the frame that's the\Nsame color nail Polish sorbet
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Always wears I've seen it before.\NHe and gelato use the same shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the frames off and line them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,36 works of art had arrived\Nat the team's hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real. It's\Na joke! It's gotta be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't look anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit your crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The slabs held sorbet's\Npreserved sliced body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the slices formed a face\Ncontorted in terror the face of a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,man who was tortured with a\Nrazor-sharp blade from head to toe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a way of sharpening\Nand prolonging the pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and for the Hitman team,\Nit was a day of revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, you don't think Sorbet was\Nsliced up right in front of Gelato, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.42,0:18:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the fear and anguish\Nmust have made him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say he probably\Nused the gag to suffocate himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Without speaking a word, the\Nboss had made his message clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, from this moment on,\Nthe two of them never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The team knew and accepted\Nthat they were on thin ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncovering the boss's true identity\Nwas unequivocally off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, until news of the boss's\Ndaughter reached their ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell, I'm gonna die\Nhere like a common rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss and his sweet drug business are\Nours, and no one's taking it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not just giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna claw our way up to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's riddled with holes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would he shoot that rat to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It went the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's trying to weed me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Respiration! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia's stand detects and\Nfollows its victim's respiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the exact same way mosquitoes\Nfeed on the blood of their victims,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,by detecting the carbon dioxide\Nthey give off when they breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's how he found me in his pocket, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And that must have been why he gave\Nup the hunt back in the alleyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When all those onlookers started\Ncrawling out of the woodwork,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,he could have hit an innocent bystander.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It was tracking my\Nbreathing from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He shot again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he can't tell the difference\Nbetween me and the rats down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at these disgusting\Nexcuses for mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.76,0:20:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And their movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be tracking a pack of rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going the same speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're moving the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I know how your powers work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know how you were finding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I do, you're about as worrisome\Nas a pesky mosquito on a balmy suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a summer night, Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I win, Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of here\Nand waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:21:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to shrink into oblivion where you belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he have...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Every rat in the pack\Nmoves the exact same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was one rat that was huffing and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,puffing a lot more than any of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.34,0:21:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of breath, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could a traveler be hitching\Na ride on your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And getting a little target practice in\Nmight do me a world of good! Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.52,0:21:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't returned to my normal\Nsize, I'd be dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, time was on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wimp-ass shrinking down to nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.66,0:21:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,again was the best thing\Nto ever happen to me! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:21:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:21:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My Stan's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this bastard's ability have\Nmade it shrink along with my size?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed\Nto shoot him dead now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You out of my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.46,0:22:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:23:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.96,0:23:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.64,0:23:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All I wanna do is to free you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.56,0:23:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.84,0:23:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm gonna freak you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.18,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna freak you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.58,0:24:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
